        <p style="color:#94a3b8; font-size:0.85rem; margin-top:0.8rem;">Braille 60×16 terminal character art, generated from the canonical Scale&nbsp;L mark with Chafa. Terminals render it in Instrument Teal (#20B8B0). Asset: <a href="/assets/linxira-logo-braille60.ansi">linxira-logo-braille60.ansi</a> · Source: <a href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-artwork">linxira-artwork</a></p>
